sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Model
    participant R as hela-runtime (trusted)
    participant S as Sandbox
    participant C as Cells

    M->>R: search("delete files")
    R-->>M: ranked paths, one line each (no schemas)
    M->>R: describe("membrane.delete_file")
    R-->>M: one TypeScript signature
    M->>R: execute(code)
    R->>S: spawn child, workspace only, no network
    S->>R: call membrane.delete_file(...)
    Note over R: roots policy · approval · audit
    R->>C: dispatch tool call
    C-->>R: result
    R-->>S: result stays inside the sandbox
    S->>S: filter · loop · join · branch
    S-->>R: logs + final value
    R-->>M: status, logs, calls, duration
